{
  "schema": "mas-benchmark-tasks/1",
  "description": "Public development set. These tasks and their answers are deliberately visible to developers; they are NOT the formal held-out set. Holding out the holdout is the point: dev answers may be changed, the sealed answers may not.",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "dev-sig-normal",
